---
import { AFFILIATE, CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Disclaimer"
	description="Editorial, financial, affiliate, and advertising disclosures for The Buzz Break."
>
	<section class="container prose page">
		<span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
		<h1>Disclaimer & disclosures</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			{SITE_TITLE} is an independent journalism and education project. This page explains the limits
			of what you'll find here and how we make money.
		</p>

		<h2>Not financial advice</h2>
		<p>
			The content on this site is for general information and education only. It is <strong
				>not</strong
			> financial, investment, legal, accounting, or tax advice, and nothing here is a recommendation
			to buy, sell, or hold any asset, security, or cryptocurrency. We don't know your personal
			circumstances, and reading this site does not create any advisor–client relationship. Markets
			and crypto are volatile and you can lose money. Always do your own research and consider
			speaking with a licensed professional before making financial decisions.
		</p>

		<h2>Developing stories & accuracy</h2>
		<p>
			We work hard to be accurate and to source every claim, but news — especially around hacks,
			markets, and investigations — develops quickly, and figures can change or be revised. We
			distinguish confirmed facts from unconfirmed reports and attribute contested claims rather
			than asserting them. If we get something wrong, email us and we'll correct it. Updated
			articles show a revised date.
		</p>

		<h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
		<p>{AFFILIATE.disclosure}</p>
		<p>
			Affiliate links are marked and never change our editorial coverage. We only mention products
			we believe are relevant to the story, and the presence of a link is not an endorsement or a
			recommendation that you buy anything.
		</p>

		<h2>Advertising</h2>
		<p>
			This site may display third-party ads to support our work. Ads are labelled, and we don't
			control the specific products advertised. Ad networks may use cookies to serve relevant ads;
			you can manage this through your browser and the ad provider's settings.
		</p>

		<h2>External links</h2>
		<p>
			We link to outside sources so you can read the original reporting. We're not responsible for
			the content, accuracy, or privacy practices of websites we link to.
		</p>

		<h2>Privacy & the newsletter</h2>
		<p>
			If you subscribe to our newsletter, we use your email address only to send you our updates,
			through our email provider, and you can unsubscribe at any time. We don't sell your data.
		</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			Questions or corrections? Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page {
		padding-top: 3rem;
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
	}
	.page .eyebrow {
		display: block;
	}
</style>
